install node:20-alpine
install vs-code
install docker




in terminal 
 npm init
 npm i  express
 npm i nodemon --save-dev





 to make image:
   docker build -t image name .
 to see image:
   docker image ls





to run container:
   docker run --name containername -d -p 4000:4000 imagename




link localhost:
   http://localhost:4000/




to stop container:
   docker stop --name containername imagename





to see container:
   docker ps





to remove container:
   docker rm express-node-app-container -f






 to open terminal in container:
  docker exec -it containername bash







to run app with hot reload:
  docker run --name express-node-app-container -v "${PWD}:/app" -d -p 4000:4000 express-node-app






to run app with hot reload read only:
   docker run --name express-node-app-container -v "${PWD}/src:/app/src:ro" -d -p 4000:4000 express-node-app








to run app with docker-compose
   docker compose up -d






to see Environment Variables:
 1- docker exec -it express-node-app-container bash
 2- printenv










to run dev compose:
 docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d









to run dev:
  docker-compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d





to build and run:
  docker-compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.prod.yml up -d --build
  




 